{"id":"n29702-7-12","stage":0,"title":"다니다 · 去","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29702-7-12-1","ko":"너는 숙제도 안 하고 놀러만 다니니?","zh":"你都不做作业，光知道出去玩吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"숙제도","meaning":"作业","explanation":"숙제：作业；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"숙제","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65226","senseId":"1","lemma":"숙제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"숙제도","audio":"/audio/9e0b6711bb4e7141e851.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러만","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀러만","audio":"/audio/f98f46e4c4043fce5fc0.mp3"}},{"text":"다니니?","meaning":"去","explanation":"다니다：去；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"7","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니니","audio":"/audio/b4796ede12feb3e1f05b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"b33db886cc66d392","term":"숙제","zh":"作业","audio":"/audio/b33db886cc66d3923b91.mp3","entryId":"65226","definition":"为了复习或预习，给学生布置的课后功课。","pronunciation":["숙쩨"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"为了某个目的而来来回回。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2168f3446d48253b70a1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29702-7-12-2","ko":"조금만 놀고 얼른 할게요.","zh":"我再玩一会儿就马上做。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"놀고","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀고","audio":"/audio/96829ed8b63a5c9eef15.mp3"}},{"text":"얼른","meaning":"快地","explanation":"얼른：快地。","readings":[{"term":"얼른","audio":"/audio/d658f4688249